WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.200
4 a.m.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.800
The whole city is still asleep.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Except my website.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.100
First order.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.600
I'm on my way.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.500
20 years.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.900
I've baked bread for whoever walked by.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.900
These days, they order from me before they're even out of bed.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.000
Ramat Gan.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.600
Florentin.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.900
The building across the street.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.600
And then... I open the shutter.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.900
212 orders.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.100
Before my first coffee.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.100
Your website works even while you sleep.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.800
HG Studio
